      "title": "Fake hypothesis evaluator carries no usage or elapsed time for a no-data outcome",
      "summary": "Stops the fake hypothesis-evaluator test double from attaching a placeholder usage and elapsed duration to a seeded outcome whose reason is no-data."
    },
